<title>NEW ZEALAND: Richmond half-yr profit NZ$2.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Richmond half-yr profit NZ$2.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  2.24 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				10.22 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  nil vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover				   257.7 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Tax					   1.25 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 24.33 vs 19.46</p>
<p>NOTE - Meat processor Richmond Limited said it was reporting half-year financial data for the first time after a change of policy. It added that a difficult first half meant it expected its full-year result to fall short of the $7.5 million consolidated after-tax result achieved in full-year 1995/96.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom +64 4 471 4273</p>
